. Keep an eye on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T09:24:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4846880-1838407329256967","game_id":"steam-4846880","kind":"update","title":"AI behavior improvements and Replay System fix - 0.0.5 Update","summary":"AI terrain avoidance prioritizationAI climb improvements - AI will prevent most stallsReplay System gun fire fix - The guns firing was bugged in replays","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T15:03:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256967","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4846880-1837955055366070","game_id":"steam-4846880","kind":"update","title":"The Replay System - Demo 0.0.4 Update","summary":"✈️ Demo Update 0.0.4 is Now Available!Pilots,A new demo update has arrived! Version 0.0.4 focuses on improving the overall gameplay experience with a brand-new replay system, smarter AI, and several gameplay fixes based on your feedback.🎥 Replay System Relive every dogfight from multiple perspectives and watch your best aerial maneuvers after the battle.🤖 AI Overhaul Enemy pilots have received significant improvements, resulting in more engaging and dynamic aerial combat.📈 XP Earnings Correction","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T13:06:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366070","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4846880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:58Z",